---
title: Chicken Stock
cooklang: 2
yield: 2%l
unit system: metric
tags: [base, stock, batch]
time:
  prep: 15 minutes
  cook: 4 hours
---

`Roast 220 °C` @chicken carcasses{2}(or wings, 1 kg) on a #roasting tray{} at 220 °C for
~oven{30%minutes} until ~{brown}.

`Simmer bare simmer` the bones in a #stockpot{} with @-water{3%l}, @onion{1}(halved, skin on),
@carrot{2}(chunks), @celery{2%stalks}, @bay leaves{2} and @black peppercorns{1%tsp}.
Skim, then hold at a bare simmer ~simmer{3-4%hours}.

`Strain` through a #fine sieve{}, cool quickly, and keep in the #fridge{} up to 4 days or
freeze in @{4} portions of @{=500%ml}.
